    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n110960" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῐλέταιρ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fond of one's
			comrades</i> or <i>partisans, true to them,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ly.</u>
				211e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.</u>
